# Build output.
build/
StarsVM.exe
StarsVM-fuzz.exe
StarsVM-pack.exe
StarsVM-prof.exe
StarsVM-harness.exe
Stars-x86.exe

tags
.gdb_history

# Generated at build time by tools/mkicon.py from the game's own
# RT_GROUP_ICON.  Not checked in: it is derived, and the artwork belongs to
# Stars!, not to this program.  A build with no stars.exe next door gets a
# comment in place of the ICON directive and still links.
StarsVM.ico
StarsVM_icon.rc

# Logs and screenshots from driving the game.
*.log
*.png

__pycache__/

# A copy of the game beside the build, so the icon step and the no-argument
# lookup find it, and the settings and saved games that appear next to it.  Not
# ours to redistribute.
stars.exe
Stars.ini

# The tutorial writes a game of its own next to the module.  Game state, not
# ours, and it appears the moment anyone runs the tutorial: the turn and
# history files, the backups it keeps, and any report it is asked to dump.
tutorial.*

# The benchmark: a saved game and a copy of the module beside it, plus the
# blessed outputs.  See tools/bench.ps1.  The game is the user's and the module
# is not ours to redistribute.
bench/
